DB iDB_PusherStim
  ROOTID 0
  NUMBER 9001
  INSTANCEOF FB_PusherStim
  COMMENT "Single instance of the pusher stimulus head. Every command member is written by the harness before an index and left at its type default here, because a defaulted scenario would run rather than refuse: a zero EndAt ends the scenario at the instant it starts, and a zero edge time is a signal that has already changed."
  INPUT
  OUTPUT
  MEMBERS
